ntrols\"","\"FY24 had no commensurate internal audit and incomplete audit trail;₹9.51 lakh CSR was unspent. FY25 audit-trail failure recurred and₹85 lakh employee misappropriation was detected. Recovery/accounting remains ND. FY26 trail improved, but secretarial report identifies missing post-listing SLB approval, MD pay-limit breach and delayed MGT14. Unmodified opinions do not negate these facts.\"","\"RPT vintage discrepancy\"","\"FY26 PDF158–159 comparative tables labelled31 March2025 reproduce FY24 tables from AR25 PDF131–132. Original FY25 SLB sales₹18.674 crore and receivable₹3.7816 crore differ. FY26 RPT sales₹21.529 crore, trade receivables₹7.0585 crore and purchases₹12.8794 crore. This is a reconciliation problem, not proof of diversion.\"","\"FY26UPDATE\"","\"Q127\"","\"Owned/hired economic model\"","\"Owned fleet226 at IPO,250+ in FY26 update and300+ claimed in Q1FY27, with25 additions costing₹12.35 crore. Counts are not exactly reconciled. FY26 hired transport cost₹126.6049 crore;80% of hired-trip value is paid upfront. Owned fleet requires replacement and truck finance. No separate owned/hired margin or utilization series is disclosed.\"","\"Concentration and moat\"","\"FY24 top five customers90.40%, top ten97.70%; H1FY25 top five84.14%, top ten96.59%. Tamil Nadu58.27% of FY24 sales. Tendered routes, partial fuel pass-through and third-party Digitify TMS constrain moat claims. Specialized ODC execution is a positive.\"","\"Revenue and profits\"","\"FY23–26 nominal revenue₹105.5233 to₹204.3508 crore. H1FY26 contracted, H2 accelerated. Constant issuer scope is not a clean volume/organic bridge because prices and owned/hired gross billing are not separated. Operating EBITDA excludes other income. Value added means revenue less direct operating costs, not audited segment gross profit.\"","\"Cash realization\"","\"FY24–26 prospectus/current CFO₹6.4594,₹0.9204,₹7.8116 crore versus PAT₹8.0719,₹10.2797,₹12.4716 crore. FY26 receivables rose₹26.3168 crore to₹60.13 crore; unbilled₹17.0777 crore; aged above six months₹4.9797 versus₹1.1759 crore. FY22 CFO benefited from₹27.3347 crore payable increase.\"","\"CFO classification\"","\"FY25 investment gains₹2.6095 crore remain within printed CFO reconciliation; CFI investment receipts₹4.70 crore equal the investment book decline. Analytical reclassification gives CFO−₹1.6891 crore and CFI−₹9.6233 crore, with unchanged total cash. Transaction-ledger confirmation is required; this is not an audited restatement.\"","\"Funding\"","\"March cash equivalents₹14.7091 crore include liquid FD₹12.2691 crore; margin FD₹0.4937 crore excluded. Debt₹17.3994 crore comprises vehicles₹12.9101 and OD₹4.4893. Current vehicle maturities₹7.4734 crore. Q1 capex₹12.35 crore uses accruals and bank finance, but amount and terms are ND. Entry cash is not the March balance.\"","\"Capital efficiency\"","\"PPE grew₹24.0242 crore FY23 to₹51.0217 crore FY26; receivables₹27.2999 to₹60.13 crore. Financing IC consistently equals equity plus debt less cash equivalents and investments. Operating-IC residual is explicit. FY25/26 cash capex₹17.545/₹25.3476 crore; replacement/growth split ND.\"","\"Execution and runway\"","\"Management reports72,689 FY26 trips and2.01 crore kilometres, plus a complex127-tonne Q1 ODC delivery.₹230 crore work orders have up-to-one-year tenor; opening backlog, execution, cancellations and remaining value are ND. They are not added to already recognized sales.\"","\"DIV\"","\"VOTE\"","\"Minority distribution and remediation\"","\"Promoters holding5,021,500 shares waived₹1.20 FY26 dividend. Public2,413,300 shares imply₹0.289596 crore cash; an October19 entrant has no entitlement. All eight AGM resolutions passed, including prospective₹25 crore each SLB and Sri Kamakshi RPT limits. Later approval does not erase prior compliance failures.\"","\"AR23\"","\"AR22\"","\"AR21\"","\"Auditor chronology\"","\"FY21–22 original reports are A.K. Lunawath. FY23 successor Gupta report identifies an Iyer & Co resignation during FY23; intervening appointment date and reason are ND. Later Jay Gupta naming change uses the same329001E firm registration and is not another resignation. No scope allegation is invented.\"","\"Contingencies\"","\"FY26 audit states no litigation affecting financial position. Prospectus accident/collection cases include₹10/₹50 lakh claims, but closure and insurer recovery are ND. No audited loan default is reported. No rating located is not proof of no rating.\"","\"Market implementation\"","\"Official NSE60 sessions fromJuly24 toOctober19 contain45 issuer rows and15 absent dates, conservatively assigned zero capacity. Mean turnover₹1,904,736 and median₹1,332,600.₹5 lakh at5% participation takes7.504 sessions.600-share lot costs₹125,100; four lots₹500,400. Spread and ASM/GSM status ND.\"","\"FY26_unbilled\"","\"FY25_unbilled\"","\"FY26_hire_cost\"","\"FY25_hire_cost\"","\"FY25_investment_gain\"","\"FY25_CFO_reclassification\"","\"FY26_operating_components\"","\"FY25_operating_components\"","\"ttm_profit\"","\"maintenance_capex\"","\"FY21_current_debt_reclass\"","\"FY21_CFO_financing_sensitivity\"","\"source\"","\"units\"","\"INR crore\"","\"Original FY21 annual report; no restated FY21 series found. Current debt reclassified from OCL. Fiscal2021 pandemic base flagged.\"","100000","\"FY22–24 prospectus restatement; FY25 original FY25 accounts; FY26 current audited\"","\".0951\"","\".1481\"","\"17.0777\"","\"14.0161\"","\"126.6049\"","\"111.1651\"","\"2.6095\"","\"Analytical only: remove investment gains from operating CFO and add to CFI; total cash unchanged. Source disposal proceeds and cost-basis require reconciliation.\"","\"supplier_employee_advances\"","\"other_receivable\"","\"customer_advance\"","\"audit_accrual\"","\"tax_asset\"","\"statutory_payable\"","\"capital_sale_advance\"","\"income_tax_provision\"","\"gratuity_current\"","\"0.1264\"","\"0.0706\"","\"0.0300\"","\"3.9774\"","\"4.0279\"","\"1.2715\"","\"4.7778\"","\"0.0458\"","\"audit_expense_accrual\"","\"0.2077\"","\"0.0235\"","\"3.3093\"","\"0.4680\"","\"1.2315\"","\"3.2867\"","\"0.0617\"","\"ND: Q1FY27 management revenue release has no complete P&L/cash flow; do not fabricate TTM earnings\"","\"ND: company does not separate replacement from growth cash capex\"","\"CFO includes increase in current debt from3.5400833to4.8694837 inside OCL; analytical remove1.3294004cr from CFO and addCFF, totalcashunchanged.\"","\"url\"","\"zip_sha256\"","\"csv_sha256\"","\"present\"","\"missing_treatment\"","\"2026-07-24\"","\"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/content/cm/BhavCopy_NSE_CM_0_0_0_20260724_F_0000.csv.zip\"","\"885df092735bcffd03abaf20d27ec0823d570dc0cbe53e0853d82e85a9beae64\"","\"619c3322d984fd5fc1cc96ab150bcadd7c145a13d3c2d647479d76bd6a78976e\"","\"0 capacity conservatively if issuer absent; not asserted as verified zero trades\"","\"2026-07-27\"","\"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/content/cm/BhavCopy_NSE_CM_0_0_0_20260727_F_0000.csv.zip\"","\"89f2b9b41830bdc306a19aaa17cdbb260600e4cc0c19468334071753380afd39\"","\"783a9837d0f1799a35dcc60db43795c32a0c38666107a31f34b7fa6247b37226\"","\"2026-07-28\"","\"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/content/cm/BhavCopy_NSE_CM_0_0_0_20260728_F_0000.csv.zip\"","\"a7fad7fc48c3e84a8ea4bc93a8c0cf936fecc65533e1bef474f63d4ec9c9a5dd\"","\"56c3d1be12bc64589953b8b6276c38bd5c980a8bae414bcbfd940aff9037f03d\"","\"2026-07-29\"","\"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/content/cm/BhavCopy_NSE_CM_0_0_0_20260729_F_0000.csv.zip\"","\"48e878eb3e4fb1156947b126f39c32b8b5b3f332ca0da6f40e78f51057eabc80\"","\"295216f074460bf05038036aa7fdfda3fb07083f2568392d66f4ae6ffa784bfa\"","\"2026-07-30\"","\"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/content/cm/BhavCopy_NSE_CM_0_0_0_20260730_F_0000.csv.zip\"","\"33b05d9d4e9c463341d95057d4f0eaa3b0efa5ee49e867c9e53c569f2a4f4c65\"","\"87a502163212df579e343724a38cd4cef4205e59b8e51d7620ed431504ef4882\"","\"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/content/cm/BhavCopy_NSE_CM_0_0_0_20260731_F_0000.csv.zip\"","\"57464436a821df9eb